        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Mel fires a barrage of projectiles that explode around a target location, dealing damage repeatedly to enemies within the area.",
        "bodyHtml": "Mel unleashes a barrage of 6/7/8/9/10 projectiles that explode in the area around a target location.<br /><br />The first explosion hit deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/85/110/135/160 + (55% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and each subsequent explosion deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(5/7/9/11/13 + (5% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, adding up to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\"> magic damage</span> total.",
