      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "MelW",
        "name": "Rebuttal",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Mel forms a barrier around herself that reflects enemy projectiles back at the attacker, prevents her from taking damage, and grants her movement speed.",
        "bodyHtml": "Mel forms a barrier around herself that reflects projectiles from enemy champions, gaining <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(80/110/140/170/200 + (70% Ability Power)) Shields</span> for 0.75 seconds and <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">40% decaying Move Speed</span> for 0.75 seconds.<br /><br />Reflected projectiles deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(40/45/50/55/60% + (0.05% Ability Power)) original damage as magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Reflected projectile damage is calculated using the original caster's attributes before damage adjustments and magic penetration.<br /><span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">Physical damage</span> is reduced by 30% when converted to magic damage.<br />Does not apply item effects from the original caster.<br />Projectiles targeting each enemy in an area are destroyed instead of reflected.</span>",
