        "name": "Solar Snare",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Mel fires a radiant orb forward, rooting those at its center while the area around it slows enemies and deals damage over time.",
        "bodyHtml": "Mel fires a radiating orb, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Rooting</span> enemies at its center for 1.5 seconds and dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/105/150/195/240 + (70% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br />The orb builds up a hostile area around it that <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> enemies by 30% and deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(16/28/40/52/64 + (8% Ability Power)) magic damage per second</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The Slow and damage-over-time effects linger on enemies for a short duration after they've left the area created by the orb.<br />Deals reduced damage when used against minions.</span>",
