        "name": "Golden Eclipse",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Mel strikes all enemies marked with Overwhelm regardless of their distance from her, dealing additional damage for each stack of Overwhelm.<br><br>Ranks of Golden Eclipse increase Overwhelm's damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive</span>: <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Overwhelm</span> damage is increased to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/70/80 + (10% Ability Power)) magic damage plus (3/4/5 + (0.75% Ability Power)) magic damage per stack</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active</span>: Mel unleashes her power on all enemies affected by <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Overwhelm</span>, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(125/200/275 + (30% Ability Power)) magic damage plus (4/7/10 + (4% Ability Power)) magic damage per <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Overwhelm</span> stack</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Can only be cast when an enemy champion is affected by <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Overwhelm</span>.</span>",
